28	/**
29	 * Authenticated session profile: GET /api/auth/me. Backend-owned fields
30	 * (avatarUrl/pictureSource/role/lastLoginAt) that the Logto id_token can't
31	 * carry — the id_token has no concept of an in-app avatar upload or login
32	 * audit trail.
33	 *
34	 * Throws with `.status` on non-OK so callers can distinguish:
35	 *   - 4xx (Bearer rejected — `profileEnrichmentFailed = "auth"`): the backend
36	 *     doesn't trust our access_token, so future Bearer calls will also 401
37	 *     until the wiring is fixed.
38	 *   - 5xx / network (transient): the session IS valid; we should keep the
39	 *     id_token-only user rather than visually-logging the user out.
40	 *   - 2xx: return the parsed AuthenticatedUserDTO, or null on Zod mismatch.
