42	 * Also decodes and logs the JWT payload (`iss`/`aud`/`exp`/`sub`) so a
43	 * future log capture reveals the audience/issuer mismatch that causes
44	 * the auth-rejection regression without redacting PII (email/name/picture
45	 * are stripped before logging).
